{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_535d81ac10dd42283939d67bbe8a3802c52f58a5ffef8942983908e0594184b4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Installation docs require Node.js >= 18 and npm >= 8, installed globally via npm install -g @clawplays/ospec-cli, verified with ospec --version / --help."}],"claim_ids":["clm_535d81ac10dd42283939d67bbe8a3802c52f58a5ffef8942983908e0594184b4"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053","id":"pg_1f971e635b13595ca0a5dbb655bdbbf9","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/clawplays-ospec-docs-installation-ar-md-be449f2ce698-dbb655bdbbf9.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_6866e5bcc3cb5cc1afd0562b3572ef84"],"title":"clawplays/ospec/docs/installation.ar.md @ be449f2ce698","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_187a580e443fed83d8ec8d04543aa3c66af299e604742089d6cab1ecbfe60924"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"For Claude Code, `ospec session hook --target claude --apply` installs a hook bundle under .ospec/hooks/claude merged into .claude/settings.json that announces dispatches, hard-blocks subagent dispatch while a required decision is pending, and is Claude-only and opt-in."},{"claim_ids":["clm_690d78b56edd195ea23e6842d51eb6a79d71ee900b654e926d7d9ef97ec8efca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Archiving writes an SKILL.index.json.archived_changes entry, refreshes docs/project/feature-catalog.md rows, and idempotently replaces ospec:last-change traceability comments — described as the engine's only write into human-owned documents, with comment failures warning rather than blocking."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d48f189365599463aed619dfbad38049d7431897bc643ff0d2a2b073cbdfa4c3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The official npm package is @clawplays/ospec-cli and the command is `ospec`; documented subcommands include init, change, goal, verify, finalize, session, execute, loop, docs, update, and layout migrate."}],"claim_ids":["clm_187a580e443fed83d8ec8d04543aa3c66af299e604742089d6cab1ecbfe60924","clm_690d78b56edd195ea23e6842d51eb6a79d71ee900b654e926d7d9ef97ec8efca","clm_d48f189365599463aed619dfbad38049d7431897bc643ff0d2a2b073cbdfa4c3"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053","id":"pg_8152288e1b8f5bed90041fb94ed0e4b9","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/clawplays-ospec-skill-md-be449f2ce698-1fb94ed0e4b9.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_e5592987911358dc9bba8c9bd2073837"],"title":"clawplays/ospec/SKILL.md @ be449f2ce698","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053"}
